%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4b3f2a8c8f344355b16a4d4296ae3f98, type: 3}
  m_Name: Scarab
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  vesselClass: 12
  entries:
  - Element: 1
    AbilityLabel: Shove
    AbilityDescription: 'The punch that rides the dash: push the RIGHT THUMBSTICK to the perimeter and the dash throws a swept PLATE - a broad disc lying flat across your course, starting on the hull and sweeping along the dash - shredding prisms, killing fauna and elementally debuffing any opposing pilot it engulfs. Everything it claims is thrown the way the punch travelled. Charge scales how hard that debuff bites: x1 at rest -> x2.5 at level 10 (magnitudeAtFullCharge on ScarabShoveDebuffByExplosionEffect, read off the shover''s replicated Charge level). The cooldown is a flat 2.5 s, and the dash itself is free and never paced. No input-event binding: the juke polls the right thumbstick directly (ScarabJukeController).'
    Input: 0
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Backdraft
    UpgradeDescription: 'The shove pushes AND pulls: the plate also claims its mirror image behind the hull, doubling the swept cylinder, and everything in the back half is dragged FORWARD through the ship. At rest the shove only pushes (ScarabCavitationBlast.PlateMirrors, per-use snapshot at fire time).'
  - Element: 2
    AbilityLabel: Switch
    AbilityDescription: 'Mass grows the switch''s RING RADIUS - the mouth a ball has to thread (PlaceSwitchActionExecutor multiplies RingRadius by the PlaceSwitchActionSO.switchScale ElementalFloat, x1 -> x2.5 at level 10, read live at placement).'
    Input: 6
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Sun Cores
    UpgradeDescription: 'A scored switch raises its dais WITH the super-shielded sun cores; without the upgrade the wings rise round empty crooks (ScarabSwitch.LaysDaisElement, snapshot at placement).'
  - Element: 3
    AbilityLabel: Nucleus Seeding
    AbilityDescription: 'While you fly, balls of your domain appear embedded in the nucleus membrane for anyone to knock loose (ScarabNucleusSeeder). Space scales the balls you seed: x1 at rest, x4 at level 10 (ScarabBallForge.SizeScaleFor, stamped once - a ball keeps the size it was born with). No input binding.'
    Input: 0
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Core Breaker
    UpgradeDescription: 'Your balls DESTROY super-shielded prisms and fly on, where a ball is otherwise spent on one (AstroLeagueBall''s replicated breaks-super-shielded stamp, read off your Space upgrade when the ball is minted, seeded or forged).'
  - Element: 4
    AbilityLabel: Throttle
    AbilityDescription: 'Time raises the top speed of the throttle ramp (authored on the transformer''s ThrottleScalerMultiplier ElementalFloat, x1 -> x1.5 at level 10). The throttle is analog on the right trigger, thrust always along the nose, and releasing it is the only brake.'
    Input: 1
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Snap Dash
    UpgradeDescription: 'Double-tap the THROTTLE (right trigger) for a hard forward burst - 500 u/s along the nose, five times the old dash - with a 5 s cooldown. Distinct from the right-stick dash, which is base kit and always available.'
  omniAbilityLabel: forges its ball
